2. If a word begins with consonants, move them to the end and add "ay".

3. If a word starts with consonants followed by "qu", move the consonants and 
"qu" to the end and add "ay".

4. If a word starts with consonants followed by "y", move the consonants before 
the "y" to the end and add "ay".



