I'll implement VLQ encoding and decoding for you.



For encoding, I break each number into 7-bit groups, add the continuation bit to
all but the last group, and reverse the order. For decoding, I read 7-bit 
groups, using bit 7 as a continuation flag, and detect overflow errors.



