The error is a classic C++ template issue. Template methods must be defined in 
the header file, not in a separate `.cpp` file, because the compiler needs to 
see the full template definition at each point of instantiation. The linker 
can't find the symbols because the `.cpp` file's template instantiations aren't 
visible to the test file.



I'll move all method implementations into the header file.



